            "action_name": {
              "value": "Dutiful Retaliation"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(eidolon, occult, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: An enemy within 15 feet of you hits you with a Strike and deals damage to you.\n\nRequirements: Your eidolon is within 15 feet of you.\n\nYour eidolon instinctively flashes with ectoplasmic energy, allowing them to strike back against an enemy who dares to harm you. Your eidolon makes a melee unarmed Strike against the triggering enemy, even if that enemy isn't within your eidolon's reach."
            },
